"""Cutline: a small multi-track video editor that runs in a browser app window.

    cutline [video]
    cutline --version

With a video, starts a new project with it. Without, opens the start screen
(recent projects and the videos in your Videos folder). Videos are never
modified: projects live in ~/.local/share/cutline/projects and "Export" renders
an MP4 next to the project's first video.

Environment:
    CUTLINE_BROWSER     browser command to open the editor window with
    CUTLINE_VIDEOS      folder listed on the start screen (default: XDG Videos)
    CUTLINE_DOWNLOADS   folder the media drawer watches (default: XDG Downloads)
    CUTLINE_NO_BROWSER  set to only start the server and print its one-time URL
"""

